1
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:06,458
Lin Zai!

2
00:00:06,833 --> 00:00:08,000
How did he end up like this?

3
00:00:10,041 --> 00:00:11,041
Lin Zai!

4
00:00:11,625 --> 00:00:12,416
I'll go get Doctor He!

5
00:00:12,583 --> 00:00:13,208
Not him!

6
00:00:13,375 --> 00:00:14,458
Go get A Cheng! Hurry!

7
00:00:30,791 --> 00:00:31,791
What...

8
00:00:32,208 --> 00:00:33,291
How did this happen?

9
00:00:50,291 --> 00:00:51,583
He's lost too much blood. It's critical.

10
00:00:51,958 --> 00:00:53,000
We need to get him a blood transfusion right now.

11
00:00:53,583 --> 00:00:54,583
But...

12
00:00:54,875 --> 00:00:56,458
Take mine. I'm type O.

13
00:00:58,000 --> 00:00:59,208
Alright, I'll go prep everything.

14
00:01:23,916 --> 00:01:24,916
He's stabilized for now.

15
00:01:25,458 --> 00:01:27,041
His body has taken a massive toll, though.

16
00:01:29,875 --> 00:01:30,875
Whether he pulls through...

17
00:01:31,208 --> 00:01:32,666
comes down to his own will to survive.

18
00:01:33,083 --> 00:01:34,125
I'll stay with him.

19
00:01:35,500 --> 00:01:36,000
Okay.

20
00:01:36,125 --> 00:01:36,625
A-Leh.

21
00:01:37,000 --> 00:01:38,083
What on earth happened?

22
00:01:38,083 --> 00:01:39,583
Who did this to Lin Zai?

23
00:01:41,541 --> 00:01:42,708
Lin Zai needs peace and quiet right now.

24
00:01:43,166 --> 00:01:44,166
Let's all step outside for now.

25
00:01:48,333 --> 00:01:51,333
A-Leh, take good care of him.

26
00:02:10,250 --> 00:02:11,250
Lin Zai...

27
00:02:12,833 --> 00:02:13,916
You have to pull through.

28
00:02:22,625 --> 00:02:24,250
I'll never leave your side again.

29
00:02:26,000 --> 00:02:27,000
I'm begging you.

30
00:02:27,291 --> 00:02:28,666
You have to wake up.

31
00:02:31,333 --> 00:02:32,708
Please, just wake up.

32
00:03:30,200 --> 00:03:34,200
"The Last Oath"

33
00:03:34,800 --> 00:03:39,300
(Episode 20)

34
00:05:23,958 --> 00:05:24,958
Lin Zai...

35
00:05:30,000 --> 00:05:31,125
You've got some nerve showing your face here!

36
00:05:37,166 --> 00:05:37,708
A-Leh!

37
00:05:38,125 --> 00:05:39,125
Stop it!

38
00:05:39,208 --> 00:05:40,291
What are you doing?!

39
00:05:40,750 --> 00:05:42,625
Stop hitting him, A-Leh!

40
00:05:44,250 --> 00:05:45,250
A-Leh!

41
00:05:46,250 --> 00:05:47,250
A-Leh!

42
00:05:47,708 --> 00:05:48,708
A-Leh!

43
00:05:48,958 --> 00:05:49,958
Don't...

44
00:05:51,750 --> 00:05:52,750
Lin Zai!

45
00:05:53,875 --> 00:05:54,875
You're awake.

46
00:05:59,875 --> 00:06:01,291
It was my choice.

47
00:06:03,500 --> 00:06:04,500
Your choice?

48
00:06:04,833 --> 00:06:06,125
He drained you half to death!

49
00:06:08,875 --> 00:06:11,708
He Yao is researching a
weapon against the zombies.

50
00:06:12,541 --> 00:06:13,541
It's a good thing.

51
00:06:14,916 --> 00:06:16,291
I wasn't paying attention. It's on me.

52
00:06:17,708 --> 00:06:18,708
It's my fault.

53
00:06:19,583 --> 00:06:21,083
I miscalculated the amount of blood drawn.

54
00:06:22,583 --> 00:06:25,208
No research justifies
gambling with human lives!

55
00:06:27,958 --> 00:06:28,958
A-Leh...

56
00:06:34,000 --> 00:06:35,000
Get out.

57
00:06:36,000 --> 00:06:37,000
Well...

58
00:06:38,416 --> 00:06:39,500
Lin Zai, get some rest.

59
00:06:39,500 --> 00:06:40,500
Get out!

60
00:06:52,583 --> 00:06:53,583
Child...

61
00:06:54,375 --> 00:06:56,541
You can't do anything so reckless ever again.

62
00:06:59,416 --> 00:07:00,416
The few of us remaining...

63
00:07:01,166 --> 00:07:03,666
can't afford to lose anyone else.

64
00:07:05,666 --> 00:07:06,666
Grandma Qiu...

65
00:07:07,583 --> 00:07:08,625
Don't worry.

66
00:07:10,500 --> 00:07:12,166
He Yao has always been good to me.

67
00:07:13,666 --> 00:07:14,875
This was just an accident.

68
00:07:18,583 --> 00:07:19,708
When I found you,

69
00:07:20,500 --> 00:07:21,708
you were lying there all by yourself.

70
00:07:21,708 --> 00:07:22,958
There wasn't a single soul around.

71
00:07:24,083 --> 00:07:25,750
What would've happened if I hadn't come back?

72
00:07:26,458 --> 00:07:29,041
He doesn't care about your life at all!

73
00:07:33,458 --> 00:07:34,458
Grandma Qiu,

74
00:07:35,000 --> 00:07:36,000
Sister Chen,

75
00:07:37,166 --> 00:07:39,625
I want to speak with A-Leh alone for a moment.

76
00:07:40,791 --> 00:07:42,083
Why don't you get some rest?

77
00:07:42,583 --> 00:07:42,958
Don't worry.

78
00:07:43,583 --> 00:07:44,583
I'll be fine.

79
00:08:14,291 --> 00:08:15,583
You stayed by my side all night.

80
00:08:21,250 --> 00:08:22,375
I thought you left.

81
00:08:23,250 --> 00:08:24,458
Why did you come back?

82
00:08:29,375 --> 00:08:30,375
Do you really...

83
00:08:32,333 --> 00:08:33,333
trust him that much?

84
00:08:34,750 --> 00:08:36,750
Enough to push yourself to the brink of death...

85
00:08:36,750 --> 00:08:37,833
just to be his test subject?

86
00:08:39,666 --> 00:08:40,666
When you clearly...

87
00:08:42,083 --> 00:08:43,583
hated being experimented on so much?

88
00:08:44,583 --> 00:08:45,750
I let you walk away.

89
00:08:45,750 --> 00:08:47,583
Why on earth would you
go this far for him?

90
00:08:50,375 --> 00:08:51,583
If you hadn't woken up...

91
00:08:52,569 --> 00:08:53,569
what would I...

92
00:09:16,583 --> 00:09:17,583
That's not it, A-Leh.

93
00:09:20,125 --> 00:09:21,250
I didn't do it for He Yao.

94
00:09:22,500 --> 00:09:23,583
It was for my brother.

95
00:09:27,166 --> 00:09:28,166
Your brother?

96
00:09:30,500 --> 00:09:31,875
My brother protected me...

97
00:09:32,375 --> 00:09:33,541
and got bitten by a zombie.

98
00:09:35,291 --> 00:09:36,583
And then, in He Yao's lab...

99
00:09:36,583 --> 00:09:37,583
I saw him.

100
00:09:39,875 --> 00:09:40,875
He Yao told me...

101
00:09:40,916 --> 00:09:42,750
he has a way to turn him back.

102
00:09:43,333 --> 00:09:44,333
That's why I did it.

103
00:09:44,416 --> 00:09:45,125
You wanted to save your brother,

104
00:09:45,125 --> 00:09:46,166
so why didn't you tell me?

105
00:09:47,583 --> 00:09:48,583
I honestly thought...

106
00:09:51,958 --> 00:09:53,416
you truly wanted me gone.

107
00:09:55,875 --> 00:09:56,875
That you didn't want me anymore.

108
00:09:58,833 --> 00:09:59,833
I was just...

109
00:10:00,708 --> 00:10:02,083
I was afraid that if you found out,

110
00:10:02,583 --> 00:10:03,625
you'd stop me.

111
00:10:09,500 --> 00:10:10,500
Lin Zai...

112
00:10:12,166 --> 00:10:14,000
So you didn't actually want to push me away,

113
00:10:14,958 --> 00:10:15,958
did you?

114
00:10:18,416 --> 00:10:19,458
I'm sorry, A-Leh.

115
00:10:20,666 --> 00:10:21,708
What I said that day...

116
00:10:22,166 --> 00:10:23,500
I didn't mean any of it.

117
00:10:34,125 --> 00:10:35,458
From now on, whatever happens,

118
00:10:37,541 --> 00:10:38,750
you have to tell me.

119
00:10:43,458 --> 00:10:44,583
No more carrying it all on your own.

120
00:10:46,250 --> 00:10:47,250
And above all...

121
00:10:48,291 --> 00:10:49,291
don't ever push me away again.

122
00:10:57,458 --> 00:10:58,458
Okay.

123
00:11:16,583 --> 00:11:17,583
Brother...

124
00:11:18,333 --> 00:11:19,333
What happened to your face?

125
00:11:22,000 --> 00:11:23,000
Nothing.

126
00:11:23,166 --> 00:11:24,166
Just took a tumble.

127
00:11:27,916 --> 00:11:28,833
That's what you used to say as a kid,

128
00:11:28,833 --> 00:11:29,916
whenever you lied to Mom.

129
00:11:31,750 --> 00:11:32,916
Did someone hit you?

130
00:11:35,458 --> 00:11:36,541
You slept for a long time this round.

131
00:11:36,833 --> 00:11:37,833
How are you feeling?

132
00:11:37,916 --> 00:11:39,125
Any pain or discomfort?

133
00:11:46,125 --> 00:11:47,125
This...

134
00:11:47,166 --> 00:11:48,166
The dosage this time...

135
00:11:52,000 --> 00:11:53,000
is all wrong.

136
00:11:53,583 --> 00:11:54,583
Brother...

137
00:11:55,250 --> 00:11:56,750
What did you do to that immune subject?

138
00:12:03,166 --> 00:12:04,875
That's why you got beaten up, wasn't it?

139
00:12:08,750 --> 00:12:09,708
Look at me!

140
00:12:09,708 --> 00:12:10,708
Answer me!

141
00:12:22,333 --> 00:12:23,333
Changhuan, what are you doing?

142
00:12:34,583 --> 00:12:35,583
He Yao!

143
00:12:36,958 --> 00:12:38,083
What have you done?!

144
00:12:39,125 --> 00:12:40,333
You promised me before,

145
00:12:40,750 --> 00:12:42,333
that you'd keep him safe!

146
00:12:43,500 --> 00:12:44,916
What do you see him as?

147
00:12:45,625 --> 00:12:46,666
A blood bank?!

148
00:12:50,333 --> 00:12:51,333
Yes!

149
00:12:52,291 --> 00:12:53,958
And he has to be!

150
00:13:01,291 --> 00:13:02,291
Without his blood,

151
00:13:02,875 --> 00:13:03,875
you'll die!

152
00:13:04,000 --> 00:13:05,000
You'll rot!

153
00:13:05,291 --> 00:13:07,375
You'll turn into a mindless monster!

154
00:13:08,333 --> 00:13:09,333
Tell me!

155
00:13:09,458 --> 00:13:10,541
If I don't use him as a blood bank,

156
00:13:10,708 --> 00:13:11,416
what am I supposed to do?!

157
00:13:11,666 --> 00:13:12,916
What other choice do I have?!

158
00:13:16,583 --> 00:13:18,375
Does that give you the right to hurt him like this?!

159
00:13:24,791 --> 00:13:25,791
He Yao...

160
00:13:27,416 --> 00:13:28,708
This is wrong!

161
00:13:31,333 --> 00:13:32,500
To me,

162
00:13:33,750 --> 00:13:35,291
right and wrong don't matter anymore.

163
00:13:35,291 --> 00:13:38,208
All I care about is bringing you back!

164
00:13:45,500 --> 00:13:47,083
You're not the He Yao I know.

165
00:13:49,000 --> 00:13:50,416
The He Yao I know...

166
00:13:50,500 --> 00:13:52,250
would never do something like this!

167
00:13:56,541 --> 00:13:57,583
Stop this.

168
00:13:58,083 --> 00:13:59,375
While there's still time...

169
00:13:59,708 --> 00:14:00,708
please?

170
00:14:31,416 --> 00:14:32,666
There's no going back.

171
00:14:36,625 --> 00:14:37,625
What are you doing?

172
00:14:43,375 --> 00:14:44,375
He Yao!

173
00:14:44,666 --> 00:14:46,125
He Yao, let me go!

174
00:14:46,958 --> 00:14:49,125
You can't keep going down this path!

175
00:14:49,500 --> 00:14:50,500
He Yao!

176
00:14:51,875 --> 00:14:53,041
He Yao!

177
00:14:54,500 --> 00:14:55,541
He Yao!

178
00:15:48,416 --> 00:15:50,166
Looks like I can't let you live after all.

179
00:15:51,750 --> 00:15:52,791
A-Leh.

180
00:16:02,416 --> 00:16:03,416
You've barely recovered,

181
00:16:03,416 --> 00:16:04,416
so don't overexert yourself.

182
00:16:05,666 --> 00:16:06,916
I'm fine, Grandma Qiu.

183
00:16:07,208 --> 00:16:08,208
Much better now.

184
00:16:24,000 --> 00:16:25,000
You made this?

185
00:16:26,083 --> 00:16:27,083
He sure did!

186
00:16:27,416 --> 00:16:29,750
This lad is full of surprises.

187
00:16:30,458 --> 00:16:32,208
He headed out before dawn,

188
00:16:32,583 --> 00:16:34,416
and actually bagged a wild pheasant!

189
00:16:35,083 --> 00:16:36,750
Brought back a bunch of fresh ingredients,

190
00:16:37,166 --> 00:16:39,583
and traded for all kinds of seasonings.

191
00:17:32,666 --> 00:17:34,375
Wow, smells incredible!

192
00:17:39,500 --> 00:17:41,625
Smells delicious!

193
00:17:43,583 --> 00:17:45,416
Man, this smells amazing!

194
00:17:45,583 --> 00:17:47,875
Where'd you hunt down a pheasant, kid?

195
00:17:50,583 --> 00:17:51,333
How about letting us have a taste?

196
00:17:51,333 --> 00:17:52,333
Hands off.

197
00:18:20,375 --> 00:18:21,791
Seriously, that smells so good!

198
00:18:24,666 --> 00:18:26,083
Out of the way.

199
00:18:28,875 --> 00:18:31,958
Go grab bowls! Bowls!

200
00:18:32,500 --> 00:18:34,250
Grab a bowl, there's enough for everyone!

201
00:18:35,041 --> 00:18:36,791
Thanks, Grandma Qiu!

202
00:18:49,833 --> 00:18:52,375
This meal has got color, aroma, and taste!

203
00:18:54,583 --> 00:18:55,708
Who would've thought...

204
00:18:55,916 --> 00:18:56,916
in a world like this...

205
00:18:57,583 --> 00:18:59,208
we'd ever taste something so good?

206
00:19:03,083 --> 00:19:03,583
Alright.

207
00:19:03,875 --> 00:19:05,500
I'll go clean up the pot.

208
00:19:05,583 --> 00:19:07,958
I'll leave the rest to you, A-Leh.

209
00:19:08,625 --> 00:19:10,333
Grandma Qiu, aren't you having any?

210
00:19:10,583 --> 00:19:12,000
I already ate.

211
00:19:13,125 --> 00:19:14,125
Alright then.

212
00:19:26,583 --> 00:19:28,083
What... What are you staring at?

213
00:19:28,250 --> 00:19:29,250
Drink it.

214
00:19:31,541 --> 00:19:34,208
I just realized you're kind of adorable.

215
00:19:36,416 --> 00:19:37,583
Nonsense.

216
00:19:39,916 --> 00:19:41,000
Just drink up.

217
00:20:17,750 --> 00:20:18,750
I never imagined...

218
00:20:19,000 --> 00:20:20,625
there'd be a spot like this in the camp.

219
00:20:21,333 --> 00:20:22,458
In the middle of the apocalypse,

220
00:20:22,916 --> 00:20:24,375
it feels like a paradise.

221
00:20:25,333 --> 00:20:27,250
Then I'll bring you here every day from now on.

222
00:20:37,458 --> 00:20:38,458
A-Leh.

223
00:20:39,500 --> 00:20:40,750
About what I said earlier...

224
00:20:40,916 --> 00:20:42,250
about saving my brother.

225
00:20:44,208 --> 00:20:46,166
You still plan on cooperating with He Yao's experiments?

226
00:20:48,583 --> 00:20:50,791
He's the only family I have left in this world.

227
00:20:51,791 --> 00:20:52,708
No matter what,

228
00:20:52,708 --> 00:20:54,083
I can't give up on him.

229
00:20:56,541 --> 00:20:57,666
You really trust He Yao that much?

230
00:20:58,833 --> 00:21:00,333
Because I saw it with my own eyes.

231
00:21:02,583 --> 00:21:04,041
My brother went from a frenzied state...

232
00:21:04,416 --> 00:21:05,666
to gradually calming down.

233
00:21:06,791 --> 00:21:08,000
Sometimes I even feel like...

234
00:21:08,791 --> 00:21:10,291
the way he looks at me...

235
00:21:10,708 --> 00:21:11,958
it's like he recognizes me.

236
00:21:12,541 --> 00:21:13,666
He just can't speak yet.

237
00:21:16,125 --> 00:21:17,208
But your body...

238
00:21:19,583 --> 00:21:20,583
I'm much better.

239
00:21:20,666 --> 00:21:21,666
I can handle it.

240
00:21:24,208 --> 00:21:25,375
I want to go see my brother.

241
00:21:31,583 --> 00:21:32,583
Okay.

242
00:21:33,000 --> 00:21:34,000
I'll go with you.
